   "text": " Sometimes you just need to go back to the basic. Kalau kulit korang tengah sensitive or breakout, jangan terlalu try banyak sangat produk. Your skin needs skincare and bukan more skincare. Kadang-kadang kita ni kan terlalu excited nak tambah macam-macam produk sampai 5 ke 6 layer. But honestly, less is better. Give your skin a break, focus dulu pada basic skincare. Ingat tiga benda ni, cleanse, hydrate, moisturize. Cleanse, hydrate and moisturize.",
